SUMMARY:Unionville Day: Nature walk + Art + Shopping  + Dinner + Markham J
 azz Festival
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Saturday August 22nd**\, **join us fo
 r a Day in Unionville and be part of the Markham Jazz Festival. The day wi
 ll feature: an Art Gallery Tour\, Nature Scenic Walk\, Shopping/Sightseein
 g on Main Street\, Dinner\, then concerts on the Millennium Bandstand Stag
 e. The final concert will have a mix of musical genres to get you dancing.
  Then\, relax on your drive back home. This is an outdoor event\, so if th
 ere is a forecast of rain\, a decision will be made 4 hours in advance to 
 cancel.**\n\n**ITINERARY**\n**2:50pm: Meet outside the [Frederick Horsman 
 Varley Art Gallery](http://www.markham.ca/Markham/Attractions/Gallery/) (V
 arley is a Group of Seven Member)**\n**3:00p: Guided tour of the Varley Ar
 t Gallery**\n**3:30p: A scenic walk through Too Good Pond Park**\n**4:00 -
  5:15pm: Sight-seeing/ shopping (Main street is a short block)**\n**5:15pm
 : Dinner**\n**6:45pm: Head over to Millennium Bandstage for final 2 concer
 ts**\n\n**Note**: **you will need to arrange your own transportation to an
 d from\, and confirm if you will be joining for dinner\, as reservations a
 re required. In addition\, all out of town events require your cell and em
 ail.**\n\n**TRANSPORTATION**:\n\n* Arrange for your own transportation. Fe
 el free to post in the Comments if you want/need to carpool.\n* **Carpool 
 attendees MUST have a picture and arrange a PUBLIC pick-up/ drop off spot 
 for the security of members**. Any risks associated with carpooling are bo
 rne by the member\, and Experience Toronto cannot be held liable under any
  circumstances.\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**COST**\nMeetup organizer fee: $10\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* 
 **RSVP Yes and answer the question about Dinner\, include your email and c
 ell\, and the system will add you to the waitlist.**\n* **Your email and c
 ell are required for out of town events - for the reminder email and for e
 mergencies the day off**\n* A reminder will be sent the day prior to your 
 email with my cell and details for the day.\n\nRSVPs close 3 days prior an
 d cancellations after may result in a No Show and impact future attendance
 .\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**1:30p**: **Leave Toronto**\n**2:50p: Meet outside 
 the [Frederick Horsman Varley Art Gallery](http://www.markham.ca/Markham/A
 ttractions/Gallery/) at 216 Main St. in Unionville (Varley is a Group of S
 even Member)**\n**3:00p: Guided tour of the Varley Art Gallery**\n**3:35p:
  A scenic walk through Too Good Pond Park**\n**4:00p: Sight-seeing/ shoppi
 ng**\n**5:15p: Dinner**\n**6:45p: Head over to Millennium Bandstage for fi
 nal 2 concerts**\n**7:00p: Ranee Lee Concert** (Ranee Lee is a multi-talen
 ted Montreal artist with 13 albums\, a Juno Award\, has starred in a Billi
 e Holiday musical\, and toured internationally)\n**8:45p:** **U. N. Jeffer
 son Concert** (U.N. Jefferson is an original Motown / Soul band from Toron
 to)\n9:30 - 10p: Head back to Toronto\n\nEnjoy and please post your commen
 ts in the event after.309
