SUMMARY:Guided Walking Tour Along The Front + Food/Drinks (Union Stn.)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Wednesday\, September 2nd**\, **join 
 me for this New Guided Walking Tour Along The Front provided by the Royal 
 Ontario Museum.** The tour will start just west of the original Town of Yo
 rk\, where we’ll explore the site of York’s original bustling market t
 hat continues to thrive today. On our walk we’ll encounter iconic and hi
 storic buildings such as the elegant Flatiron Building\, the Royal York Ho
 tel\, spacious theatres\, the breathtaking Galleria & more. One of the cit
 y’s earliest thoroughfares\, the landscape of Front St. East has undergo
 ne many changes over the years. On our walk\, we’ll see an examine these
  changes\, including the new North Market building at St. Lawrence Market\
 , and the renovation and restoration of Union Station and other buildings.
 \n\nAlso on our walk\, we’ll take in modern buildings\, spaces\, and scu
 lptures that add even more to the story of this historic and vibrant stree
 t. These Tours are guided by docents\, and run rain or shine. However\, if
  the forecast calls for rain\, I will make a call 3 hours prior if I will 
 show up\, as others may want to continue in the rain\, which the forecast 
 has been off a lot recently.\n\n**Prepare for the walk:**\n\n* Walking sho
 es\n* Hat\n* Sunglasses\n* Water\n\n‐‐----‐----‐‐-------------
 ‐-----------\n**COST:**\nMeetup Organizer Fee: $5\n\n‐‐----‐----
 ‐‐-------------‐-----------\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP confirming i
 f you will join for food/ drinks after**\n* A reminder will be sent the da
 y before with my cell and reminder details where to meet and when.\n\nRSVP
 s close 1 day prior and cancellations may result in a No Show and impact f
 uture attendance\n\n**MEETUP DETAILS:**\n**Meet at: 5:45pm at SW corner at
  Front & George St.**\n\n**Tour location:** We will then join the rest of 
 the tour group at the NW corner (near 106 Front St. E.)\n\n**Tour starts: 
 at 6pm**\n\n**Tour ends:** Front St. W and Bay St. (near Fairmont Royal Yo
 rk Hotel) 100 Front St. W.\n\n**Walk length:** less than 2 hours\n\n**Afte
 r**: Head over to a local restaurant\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comment
 s in the event after
