SUMMARY:Virtual REGISTER: Thriving Through Change and Uncertainty
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: After you RSVP\, you will also nee
 d to Register to receive your link to the event.**\n\nOn **Wednesday\, Sep
 tember 16th\,** **join the webinar** **Your Optimism WILL Save You: Thrivi
 ng Through Change and Uncertainty**. Change is inevitable.\nDid you know y
 ou can develop skills to respond to it? In this interactive session\, psyc
 hologist and bestselling author of [The Power of Real Optimism](https://ww
 w.amazon.com/dp/1668081121?lv=shuf&channelId=500&plpRedirect=mhFallback "h
 ttps://www.amazon.com/dp/1668081121?lv=shuf&channelId=500&plpRedirect=mhFa
 llback")\, [Dr. Deepika Chopra](https://www.drdeepikachopra.com/ "https://
 www.drdeepikachopra.com/")\, explores the science of optimism as a practic
 al\, evidence-based approach to building resilience\, adaptability\, and w
 ell-being during periods of uncertainty.\nShe will share practical tools f
 or your personal tool kit to help you manage stress\, navigate change with
  greater confidence\, and develop the psychological flexibility needed to 
 thrive in today’s evolving workplace.\n\n**Dr. Deepika will share:**\n\n
 * Why uncertainty feels so challenging to the brain and how to respond mor
 e effectively\n* The difference between real optimism and toxic positivity
 \n* Practical strategies for building resilience and psychological flexibi
 lity\n* How optimism improves adaptability\, decision-making\, and perform
 ance during change\n* Simple daily practices to reduce stress and stay gro
 unded in uncertain times\n\n**COST**\nFree\n\n**SIGNING UP**\n\n* Simply R
 SVP Yes\n* **[Register](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/your-optimism-will-sa
 ve-you-thriving-through-change-and-uncertainty-tickets-1995004269474)** fo
 r the talk and you receive a confirmation email on how to access your zoom
  link to the event\n* **Start time: 1pm when you will click on link provid
 ed directly to you**\n* Length: 1 hour\n* RSVPs close 1 day prior to start
  time\, hoping spots are still available\n*\n\nEnjoy and please post your 
 Comments after!
